5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need a system based on actual data. I want to know the real time commitment and if professional help is viable.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I agree! It feels like some of us do more than others. I want to see who is actually using the rooms.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am more concerned with our harmony. I want to see why we've clashed in the past and what worked for others.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know about the money! Who is paying for the soap and how much does it actually cost?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just want it to be consistent. I want to know why the cleanliness changes so much between people.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Ryuji,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, that's a good point. Maybe we should look at the house chat to see where the fights start?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"That is exactly what I was thinking, Mio.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm going to look at the receipts! And maybe the management office stuff too.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll look into what everyone considers ""done.""","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
