35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"A full pass takes over an hour and a half. An outside firm requires us to tidy first, which doesn't fully remove the burden.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,"It's totally uneven! Only a few of us really use the kitchen, and some people are barely even home for a month!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"I've found that our arguments stem from reminders, and previous tenants who split rooms permanently ended up not speaking.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"We're wasting money buying the same spray twice! And the management cleaner is 4,200 yen an hour.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found out why it's inconsistent. We all have different ideas of what ""clean"" means. Also, the bathroom grout gets dirty in eleven days.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"If the bathroom degrades that quickly, a weekly rota might be too slow. We need a high standard.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,But it's not fair to make someone who is away for a month do a full week of cleaning!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, if we force a strict rota or permanent roles, we risk the same resentment the previous tenants had.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"If we hire a pro, we can just split the bill. But we need to make sure everyone actually pays their share!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I think... if we have a professional, the standard would be the same every time. I wouldn't have to guess.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,A professional service is the most rational way to ensure a consistent standard without wasting our own time.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,I just don't want the people who only make coffee to pay the same as the heavy cooks.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, splitting the cost equally is simpler and less likely to cause the ""reminders"" that lead to fights.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,I agree with Victoria! As long as we have a clear way to settle the invoice every month.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I like the idea of a professional. It would make me feel much more comfortable in the bathroom.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,The time saved is significant. I vote for the service.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm still worried about fairness, but I guess it's better than fighting.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,It removes the personal friction of policing each other. I support the service.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,Me too! No more guessing who paid for the sponges!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. I vote for the cleaning service.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
